  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>The Neuroport's architecture is modified to partition a portion of neural bandwidth into a hardened channel. Because sometimes, the best offense is a good defense.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Neuroport Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> Provides the Neuroport with two additional Neuralware Option Slots, but these slots can only be used to install Self-ICE.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to the From the Ashes LC for this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Neural Link<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corgo calls this a Neuroport; the core system's equivalent is the Neural Link.</li>\n<li>The +2 slots are applied automatically; the sheet won't enforce that they only take Self-ICE.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
